{"id":"n57675-1-8","stage":3,"title":"밥그릇 · 饭碗","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57675-1-8-1","ko":"어머, 우리 아들이 웬일로 밥그릇을 싹싹 비웠네.","zh":"哎呀，我们儿子怎么把饭碗都吃得干干净净的呀。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦。","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"아들이","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아들이","audio":"/audio/66c10dc67bde9a897d9b.mp3"}},{"text":"웬일로","meaning":"什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么","explanation":"웬일：什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"웬일","audio":"/audio/9641672a10627d984dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69528","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"웬일로","audio":"/audio/3bafd362868730ccd814.mp3"}},{"text":"밥그릇을","meaning":"饭碗","explanation":"밥그릇：饭碗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥그릇","audio":"/audio/8db5aa12f25b88c722ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57675","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥그릇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥그릇을","audio":"/audio/b896f5ab2999578bf999.mp3"}},{"text":"싹싹","meaning":"一点都不剩地，全部。","explanation":"싹싹：一点都不剩地，全部。","readings":[{"term":"싹싹","audio":"/audio/fb31c476dc62b2607b4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66115","senseId":"3","lemma":"싹싹","ori